WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.402
Photogression — explore composition with the bundled forest example.
Guides and reframing do not edit the original.

2
00:00:08.402 --> 00:00:13.557
Reveal estimated depth. Model download requires consent.
Desktop browser capture; not a physical-phone test.

3
00:00:13.557 --> 00:00:21.557
Real Depth Anything V2 Small inference, processed in the browser.
Relative depth only — not measured distances. Download wait omitted.

4
00:00:21.557 --> 00:00:28.514
Contours, exaggerated relief and depth-edge separation.
These are creative views of an AI estimate.

5
00:00:28.514 --> 00:00:32.312
Mesh view reveals the estimated surface geometry.

6
00:00:32.312 --> 00:00:35.854
Points view samples the same estimated depth field.

7
00:00:35.854 --> 00:00:40.777
Depth colormaps show relative near/far ordering.

8
00:00:40.777 --> 00:00:45.104
Return to the natural view and keep the experiment locally.

9
00:00:45.104 --> 00:00:53.161
Compare the photograph with its estimated structure.

10
00:00:53.161 --> 00:00:57.721
Progression keeps the saved experiment settings in this browser.
